# 🕵️ Marketing Detective

## Day 34 – Marketing Analytics with Claude

### Overview

Marketing Detective is an interactive detective-style learning application that transforms marketing analytics into an engaging investigation game. Instead of simply viewing campaign reports, users analyze evidence, organize clues, identify marketing mistakes, and discover the reasoning behind successful and unsuccessful campaigns.

The project was built as part of the **ABTalks 60-Day AI Challenge** using Claude.

---

## Features

* 🕵️ Detective-themed investigation experience
* 📂 Multiple randomized marketing cases
* 📌 Interactive evidence board
* 🎯 Campaign performance analysis
* 📊 Marketing metrics visualization
* 💬 Customer feedback analysis
* 📈 Social media performance review
* 🧩 Drag-and-drop evidence organization
* ✅ Marketing mistake identification
* 📖 Detailed learning report after each case
* 🎨 Multiple UI color themes
* 📱 Fully responsive single-page application

